5,0,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone. I am Minato. I hope we can find the truth together.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,Greetings. Let us proceed with logic and calm. I am Benjamin.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Servas,,"A new day dawns. Wisdom lies in patience, my young friends.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,May,,"Hi there! I'm May. Let's make this fun, shall we?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,Hey. I'm Takumi. I won't back down from this.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minato,,I feel a bit nervous. Who should we trust first?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,Trust is earned through consistency. Let us observe before we judge.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Servas,,Indeed. The mind must be clear before the heart can act.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,May,,I agree with Benjamin. No need to rush into accusations yet.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,I'm ready to defend whoever is innocent. Just say the word.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minato,,That sounds good. I will listen carefully to everyone's words.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,A good approach. Silence is often more telling than speech.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Servas,,The old man nods. We shall see who stands firm.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,May,,I'm just here to enjoy the game. Let's keep it light.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm not here to play. I'm here to win.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minato,,Okay. I will skip my turn to let others speak.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,Understood. I will also pass to gather more information.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Servas,,I yield the floor. Let the younger voices lead for now.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,May,,I'll pass too. Let's see what happens next.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
